# Old WordPress addresses (worldschoolingjourneys.com before the move) → new pages, 301.
# Imported by the worldschoolingjourneys.com site block (see server/Caddyfile.site). Copy to the VPS:
#   scp server\old-site-redirects.caddy melike@178.105.202.222:~/   then on the VPS: sudo cp ~/old-site-redirects.caddy /etc/caddy/
# Cruise targets use the booking code: the cruise page switches the address to its current name.
